    "by %@, at %@ a day, Monday to Friday, in quick lessons on what comes up most. The full lessons come once there's more time." : {
      "comment" : "What an exam course's example plan holds in quick lessons",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "bis %1$@, mit %2$@ täglich von Montag bis Freitag, in schnellen Lektionen zu den häufigsten Themen. Die vollständigen Lektionen folgen, sobald mehr Zeit ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "by %1$@, at %2$@ a day, Monday to Friday, in quick lessons on what comes up most. The full lessons come once there's more time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "para el %1$@, con %2$@ al día, de lunes a viernes, en lecciones rápidas sobre lo que más aparece en el examen. Las lecciones completas se incluyen cuando hay más tiempo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "d’ici le %1$@, à raison de %2$@ par jour, du lundi au vendredi, avec des leçons rapides sur les sujets les plus fréquents. Les leçons complètes viennent quand il y a plus de temps."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "entro il %1$@, con %2$@ al giorno, dal lunedì al venerdì, in lezioni veloci sugli argomenti più frequenti. Le lezioni complete arrivano quando c’è più tempo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@まで、月〜金に1日%2$@、頻出内容をクイックレッスンで学びます。時間に余裕ができたら、通常のレッスンに進みます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@까지 월요일부터 금요일까지 하루 %2$@씩, 자주 출제되는 내용을 짧은 레슨으로 공부해요. 시간이 더 생기면 정규 레슨으로 공부해요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "do %1$@, po %2$@ dziennie, od poniedziałku do piątku, w szybkich lekcjach o tym, co najczęściej pojawia się na egzaminie. Pełne lekcje pojawią się, gdy będzie więcej czasu."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "até %1$@, com %2$@ por dia, de segunda a sexta, em aulas rápidas sobre o que mais cai. As aulas completas vêm quando houver mais tempo."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ tarihine kadar, pazartesiden cumaya günde %2$@, sınavda en sık çıkan konularda hızlı derslerle. Daha fazla zaman olduğunda tam dersler de eklenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "by %@, at %@ a day, Monday to Friday, what comes up most first: %@ of the course's %lld lessons." : {
      "comment" : "What an exam course's example plan holds of its lessons",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "bis %1$@, mit %2$@ täglich von Montag bis Freitag, die häufigsten Themen zuerst: %3$@ von %#@total@ des Kurses."
